   "talkNote": "She sits on the rubble combing her hair with a silver comb, keening for a Haldane: one of that name is still under the stone, and the water is coming for him when the gate fails. If asked, she says plainly where he is (the east gallery of the cistern above, unless he is with the player) and that the song will not stop until he is out of the ground or in it. She does not decide who dies; she only sings."
